e.", "originalText": "Les nombres sont rangés dans le même ordre pour les trois photos. Le même dauphin suit la forme de l'empreinte,\nmalgré une autre date. Un autre dauphin n'a pas de forme commune.", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "de30", "type": "image", "x": 68, "y": 1955.4514285714286, "width": 1384, "height": 1285.462783171521, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2910, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3930, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fileId": "f4", "status": "saved", "scale": [1, 1], "crop": null}, {"id": "de31", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1560, "y": 1761.4514285714286, "width": 1160, "height": 1507.462783171521, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 3007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4061, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "de32", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1560, "y": 1761.4514285714286, "width": 1160, "height": 76, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 3104, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4192, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "de33", "type": "text", "x": 1588, "y": 1781.4514285714286, "width": 1104, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 3201, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4323, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "6. La mesure : le cosinus est un angle", "originalText": "6. La mesure : le cosinus est un angle", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "de34", "type": "text", "x": 1588, "y": 1865.4514285714286, "width": 1104, "height": 93, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 3298, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4454, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Chaque empreinte est une direction. Plus l'angle est petit, plus le cosinus est proche de\n1 et plus les photos se ressemblent. L'angle de chaque point est son vrai cosinus sur les\n688 nombres. Haut et bas ne servent qu'à séparer les deux groupes.", "originalText": "Chaque empreinte est une direction. Plus l'angle est petit, plus le cosinus est proche de\n1 et plus les photos se ressemblent. L'angle de chaque point est son vrai cosinus sur les\n688 nombres. Haut et bas ne servent qu'à séparer les deux groupes.", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "de35", "type": "image", "x": 1588, "y": 1986.4514285714286, "width": 1104, "height": 1111.1192998618149, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 3395, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4585, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fileId": "f5", "status": "saved", "scale": [1, 1], "crop": null}, {"id": "de36", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2800, "y": 1761.4514285714286, "width": 940, "height": 1507.462783171521, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 3492, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4716, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "de37", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2800, "y": 1761.4514285714286, "width": 940, "height": 76, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 3589, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4847, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "de38", "type": "text", "x": 2828, "y": 1781.4514285714286, "width": 884, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 3686, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 1834258923, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1794346422276, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "7. L'index : toutes les photos sur une carte", "originalText": "7. L'index : toutes les photos sur une carte", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "de39", "type": "text", "x": 2828, "y": 1865.4514285714286, "width": 884, "height": 93, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 3783, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5109, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Chaque point est une photo. Pour dessiner sur 2 axes, on compresse les\n688 nombres (ACP), ce qui perd beaucoup d'information : c'est une aide\nvisuelle. La vraie recherche se fait sur les 688 nombres.", "originalText": "Chaque point est une photo. Pour dessiner sur 2 axes, on compresse les\n688 nombres (ACP), ce qui perd beaucoup d'information : c'est une aide\nvisuelle. La vraie recherche se fait sur les 688 nombres.", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "de40", "type": "image", "x": 2828, "y": 1986.4514285714286, "width": 884, "height": 1029.451866404715, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 3880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5240, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fileId": "f6", "status": "saved", "scale": [1, 1], "crop": null}, {"id": "de41", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 3508.9142117429496, "width": 3700, "height": 574.8059171597633, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 3977, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5371, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "de42", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40, "y": 3508.9142117429496, "width": 3700, "height": 76, "angle": 0, "